    "termsSection1Title": "Introduction",
    "termsSection1Content": "Welcome to Trek Vietnam, an application that supports navigation, logging trekking journeys, and connecting outdoor enthusiast communities in Vietnam. By registering an account, you agree to comply with these terms.",
    "termsSection2Title": "Terms of Service",
    "termsSection2Content": "You must be 16 years of age or older or have guardian supervision to use the application. You are solely responsible for password security and all activities under your account.",
    "termsSection3Title": "User Rights and Obligations",
    "termsSection3Content": "Users are allowed to use offline maps, store travel history, and share healthy trekking photos with the community. Acts of vandalizing data or posting misleading information about border maps or sensitive landmarks are strictly prohibited.",
    "termsSection4Title": "Intellectual Property Rights",
    "termsSection4Content": "All source code, graphic designs, badge systems, and proprietary trekking route databases are the property of Trek Vietnam. Any unauthorized copying is strictly prohibited.",
    "termsSection5Title": "Limitation of Liability",
    "termsSection5Content": "Trekking is an outdoor extreme sport. We provide GPS maps for reference and are not liable for any accidents, natural risks, or getting lost on actual trails.",
    "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
    "privacySection1Title": "Data Collection",
    "privacySection1Content": "We collect registration information (Name, Email, Avatar) and specifically your GPS location data (even when the app runs in the background) to map trekking routes and enable check-in features.",
    "privacySection2Title": "Data Usage",
    "privacySection2Content": "Location data is used to display your position on outdoor maps, tally total distance traveled, and unlock personal exploration badges.",
    "privacySection3Title": "Data Sharing",
    "privacySection3Content": "Your information and trekking history are only shared publicly when you actively click 'Publish Post' in Community forums or share badges to social networks.",
    "privacySection4Title": "Information Security",
    "privacySection4Content": "Trek Vietnam applies advanced end-to-end encryption measures to protect your personal information and coordinate data from unauthorized access.",
